herdr-pi-subagents-status

This package includes a modified version of Herdr's Pi reporter:
  Project: Herdr (herdrdev/herdr)
  Source: src/integration/assets/pi/herdr-agent-state.ts
  URL: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr
  License: Apache License 2.0, included in LICENSE

Based on Herdr's Pi integration version 8.
Modifications include ordinary pi-subagents status aggregation, lifecycle
listener cleanup, timestamp-backed report sequences, a duplicate-reporter
warning, standalone Pi packaging, and regression tests.

This is an independent Pi extension, not Herdr's managed integration.
